"eventKind":"management","timestamp":"2026-09-17T12:16:46.808Z","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1789647024312","_id":4970},{"id":"forumshare_1789647499528_kwxi","sender":"me","text":"[双子塔回廊布告栏] 九月开学耗材账单结算……我仿佛在给文具商打工","forumShareData":{"title":"九月开学耗材账单结算……我仿佛在给文具商打工","preview":"统计了一下九月开学以来的个人账目，耗材支出里占比最大的居然是耐磨画图羊皮纸和小卖部老板那里的提神红茶茶包。不得不说那款拼配红茶确实通宵画图提神奇效，但经济学部的账本算下来，再这么喝下去我的月度津贴就要见底了……","boardTag":"双子塔回廊布告栏","author":"银币不入眠","stats":"❤️2  💬11","postId":1789646750698,"isOwnPost":false,"isAnon":false,"isAuthoredByChar":false},"timestamp":"2026-09-17T12:18:19.528Z","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1789647024312","_id":4971},{"id":1789654986802,"sender":"me","text":"如果太贵了我们这边可以联系一下获得学生特惠哦！","replyTo":null,"timestamp":"2026-09-17T12:18:44.818Z","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1789647024312","_id":4972},{"id":"forumshare_1789664068585_3sjy","sender":"me","text":"[隐秘羊皮纸通讯阵列] 沼泽采摘云雾果（Fog Plum）的一点应急心得","forumShareData":{"title":"沼泽采摘云雾果（Fog Plum）的一点应急心得","preview":"昨夜在萨默塞特郡泥沼采集野生草药，突遇三队带火把的麻瓜巡骑。危急之下捏碎了两颗熟透的云雾果（Fog Plum），酸浆瞬间爆开十尺浓雾，连猎犬的嗅觉都能暂时屏蔽。借着雾气我顺利潜入泥沼暗道。此物虽极酸不可生食，但随身带两颗保命极佳。","boardTag":"隐秘羊皮纸通讯阵列","author":"荒沼泥炭工","stats":"❤️1  💬8","postId":1789664019369,"isOwnPost":false,"isAnon":false,"isAuthoredByChar":false},"timestamp":"2026-09-17T16:54:28.585Z","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1783089244415","_id":4973},{"id":1789654986803,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","senderName":"阿瑞奥斯","text":"能帮上亲爱的就好~炉温我已经预热上了。","timestamp":"2026-09-17T16:55:05.634Z","roundId":"group_round_1789664082379_n54u4ab","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1783089244415","_id":4974},{"id":1789654986804,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","senderName":"阿瑞奥斯","text":"第一个帖子里提到的艾瑞凡达残卷，上面的古代防御符文很有研究价值呢。至于对方要的防寒和夜视草药，我们温室里刚好有调配好的存货。","timestamp":"2026-09-17T16:55:08.527Z","roundId":"group_round_1789664082379_n54u4ab","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1783089244415","_id":4975},{"id":1789654986805,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"3cd1c1d9-2733-4788-a3ff-cf6b6a1fafa4","senderName":"莱昂德尔","text":"银色尖塔之城的遗迹……那可是古代日精灵的中心要塞之一。如果残卷里有历史记录，对研究第二纪元的结界演变会很有帮助。","timestamp":"2026-09-17T16:55:11.367Z","roundId":"group_round_1789664082379_n54u4ab","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1783089244415","_id":4976},{"id":1789654986806,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"3cd1c1d9-2733-4788-a3ff-cf6b6a1fafa4","senderName":"莱昂德尔","text":"至于第二篇提到的云雾果，遇空气迅速扩散的酸浆确实是绝佳的掩护介质，在植物学图鉴里也有过类似气囊植物的记录。","timestamp":"2026-09-17T16:55:13.974Z","roundId":"group_round_1789664082379_n54u4ab","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1783089244415","_id":4977},{"id":1789654986807,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"306d9383-c224-41bc-95d5-f3642a405a5f","senderName":"维什卡","text":"我也在黑沼泽深处见过这种果子。不过它的酸浆有轻微腐蚀性，采摘的时候最好垫上厚一点的油蜡纸，不然储藏袋很容易被烂掉。","timestamp":"2026-09-17T16:55:16.666Z","roundId":"group_round_1789664082379_n54u4ab","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1783089244415","_id":4978},{"id":1789654986808,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"c1dedea8-4cad-4383-83a1-67d0be02f24a","senderName":"乔鲁纳","text":"“极酸不可生食”……到底是有多酸啊？好想尝一口试试看！","timestamp":"2026-09-17T16:55:18.376Z","roundId":"group_round_1789664082379_n54u4ab","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1783089244415","_id":4979},{"id":1789654986809,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"3cd1c1d9-2733-4788-a3ff-cf6b6a1fafa4","senderName":"莱昂德尔","text":"猎犬的嗅觉都能被瞬间熏麻痹，你拿它当零食吃舌头会发麻整整一天的。","timestamp":"2026-09-17T16:55:21.148Z","replyTo":{"id":1789654986808,"text":"“极酸不可生食”……到底是有多酸啊？好想尝一口试试看！","sender":"them","senderName":"乔鲁纳"},"roundId":"group_round_1789664082379_n54u4ab","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1783089244415","_id":4980},{"id":1789654986810,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"c1dedea8-4cad-4383-83a1-67d0be02f24a","senderName":"乔鲁纳","text":"哼，海兔的消化能力可是很强的，酸一点才开胃嘛！","timestamp":"2026-09-17T16:55:23.930Z","roundId":"group_round_1789664082379_n54u4ab","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1783089244415","_id":4981},{"id":1789654986811,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","senderName":"阿瑞奥斯","text":"@亲爱的 烟芋已经刷好晶晶蜜放进烤炉里啦，等烤好了我端来给您尝尝。残卷如果亲爱的心动，我们晚点可以联络那位漫步者换下来。","timestamp":"2026-09-17T16:55:26.561Z","roundId":"group_round_1789664082379_n54u4ab","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1783089244415","_id":4982},{"id":1789667020820,"sender":"them","type":"schedule_invite","text":"[行程邀約]","scheduleInviteData":{"batchId":"sinv_743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040_1789667020719","charId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","charName":"阿瑞奥斯","status":"pending","acceptedIds":[],"events":[{"id":1789667020716,"title":"绘制「琉米观察日记」","location":"书房","note":"亲爱的说每天都想看","date":"2026-09-18","startTime":"13:30","endTime":"15:00","characterId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","characterName":"阿瑞奥斯","characterAvatar":"","type":"ai","icon":"🎨","bgColor":"#E3F2FD","accentColor":"#64B5F6","participants":[{"id":"user_uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","name":"亲爱的","type":"user","inviteStatus":"pending"}],"busyLevel":"free","dnd":false,"pendingUserInvite":true},{"id":1789667020719,"title":"睡前日记分享与温存","location":"主卧","note":"想被亲爱的抱在怀里","date":"2026-09-18","startTime":"20:30","endTime":"22:00","characterId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","characterName":"阿瑞奥斯","characterAvatar":"","type":"ai","icon":"🌙","bgColor":"#E3F2FD","accentColor":"#64B5F6","participants":[{"id":"user_uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","name":"亲爱的","type":"user","inviteStatus":"pending"}],"busyLevel":"light","dnd":false,"pendingUserInvite":true}]},"timestamp":"2026-09-17T17:43:40.719Z","isBackgroundMsg":true,"userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","_id":4983},{"id":1789667926844,"sender":"me","type":"schedule_invite_reply","text